# **AlgoDesk Google — Critical Architecture & Code Review**



Not ready for live trading

Architecture review in progress



**My initial assessment:** AlgoDesk has a substantial amount of implemented functionality, and I would not recommend throwing it away and rebuilding it. However, I would also not recommend adding more trading features until several architectural and execution-safety problems are addressed.

The repository has a reasonable starting structure, but it does not yet meet the standards I would expect from a production-grade algorithmic trading platform.

